    {
      "id": "glossary-in-the-app",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "In the app",
      "position": {
        "x": -180,
        "y": 80
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "In the app",
        "body": "Words for finding your way.\n\n- **inside** — Where you are after entering a graph: standing on its ground.\n- **trail** — The path at the top of the window: Workspace › graph › node › Inside.\n- **going through** — Following a Portal, or the end of a line, to where it leads.\n- **Tidy** — Arranging the workspace: graphs joined by a Bridge close together (imports on the left, exports on the right), Portal graphs further out.",
